## Code-level regression basis
git diff shows the has-store owner path is unchanged except `stores[0]` -> `stores->first()`
(VendorLoginController::login) and an added early-return branch in storeSubscriptionCheck()
gated on `$store === null` (never true for a has-store vendor, since $store->store_business_model
check happens first and both branches are read-only, non-mutating on this path). No field in the
200 response shape changed for the has-store path.
